+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| HAPPY_PATH (prepared) | era 3, wide fan, health on + win surge 90 | the surge passes (uptime ~100%); `Run_Won` fires at the deactivation tick (3000); no drops, no breach, no crisis (AC-E13 rides along) | n/a |
+| SUSTAINED_BREACH (unprepared) | narrow path, health on | windowed loss breaches → `Grace_Started{streaming}` → countdown → `Grace_Expired` → drain 2/tick → meter 0 → `Run_Lost` (Error 404) | n/a |
+| E30 hysteresis | class oscillating around the tolerance | no latch flap per tick: ENTER only above the tolerance, EXIT only ≤ tolerance − margin | n/a |
+| E30 re-breach in grace | class exits + re-enters during an active grace | countdown NOT restarted (one countdown per episode) | n/a |
+| Grace recovery | breach → player fixes → healthy during grace | grace cancelled, no drain, no event; refill only after the healthy streak gate | n/a |
+| Never-lose exploit | flapping line (deep breach ↔ recovery) | each episode burns the shared per-class grace; refill is gradual (5/tick after 50 healthy ticks) — the meter MUST eventually drain on sustained flapping | n/a |
+| E16 max-not-sum | two classes draining (severities 1 + 2) | drain = 2/tick, NOT 3 | n/a |
+| E16 per-tick cap | a severity > cap | drain = the cap; meter cannot empty faster than 100/cap ticks | n/a |
+| Recharge | all classes healthy | meter +1/tick toward 100 | n/a |
+| E17 empty meter | drain tick where meter would hit 0 | `Run_Lost` emitted; NO `Grace_Expired`/`Meter_Changed` that tick; terminal latched; `win_lose_eval` skipped (no double terminal); post-terminal ticks frozen | n/a |
+| Win/lose same-tick | surge window ends AND meter empties the same tick | `Run_Lost` (health_update precedes win_lose_eval in the spine — pinned) | n/a |
+| E24 zero-demand | no completed traffic in the window | neutral: no breach, no drain, no win (a zero-completion surge window yields no `Run_Won` — never a fake win; the meter governs) | n/a |
+| Health disabled | `health_enabled` false (all pre-4.3 demos) | meter inert: no events, no drain, no Run_Lost; behavior unchanged; T1 shifts only via the catalog_hash fold; T2 byte-identical | n/a |
+| Terminal (E17) | run frozen | `health_update` skipped by the step barrier — health state frozen | n/a |
+| Replay (E10) | blessed log re-sim | identical meter/grace/events (the ring is derived; the diff is re-step-safe); replay gate rejects divergence | n/a |
+| Retry (ODN-13) | Game_Over → fresh run | fresh run context: meter 100, no grace/breach/ring/events/terminal leakage (pinned) | n/a |
+| Catalog validation | `window_ticks` 0/negative, margins > tolerances, negative severities/graces, cap 0, win_uptime_pct > 100 | load aborts with a named error | fail-fast (ODN-5) |
