+# health_lose.dem — Story 4.3: the LOSE frame (Error 404 — the Network Health
+# meter). The unprepared narrow path (the crisis shape): the era-3 base demand
+# (2 streaming/tick x 60 u) saturates the 5 u/tick narrows within ticks — the
+# E9 lane bound fills, sheds accrue, and the WINDOWED loss breaches at ~tick 5
+# (0.25 s). The streaming grace (400 ticks = 20 s) counts down (Grace_Started
+# at ~5, Grace_Expired at ~405), then the meter drains 2/tick -> empty at
+# ~452 (22.6 s — READ from the run) -> Run_Lost (Error 404) -> the terminal
+# barrier freezes the run (E17 — one terminal event). The death precedes the
+# surge window (1200), so there is no crisis banner — the lose surface is the
+# meter itself:
+#   capture 5000ms  — in grace: the meter 100 + the streaming grace chip
+#   capture 21000ms — draining: the meter ~68 (tick 420, mid-drain)
+#   capture 23000ms — the terminal frame: the meter at 0 (tick 460, frozen)
+# run 24000ms lets the post-terminal ticks exercise the barrier (frozen hashes).
+seed 4243
+run 24000ms
+era 3
+health on
+win surge 90
+fixture off
+spawn_node residential 8 15
+spawn_node router_basic 14 15
+spawn_node content_host 20 15
+at 100ms draw 0 1 narrow
+at 100ms draw 1 2 narrow
+capture at 5000ms
+capture at 21000ms
+capture at 23000ms
+expect hash stable
